  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3 St&#xf6;d till v&#xe4;rldssj&#xf6;fartsuniversitetets (WMU) driftsbudget (Malm&#xf6;). Lyder under IMO. Tillhandah&#xe5;ller internationella mastersutbildningar relaterade till handlessj&#xf6;fartens olika delomr&#xe5;den, i f&#xf6;rsta f&#xf6;r persoenr fr utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder. 2008 utbetalade Sida halva planerade bidraget, och UD resterande. Fr&#xe5;n 1 jan 2009 ansvarar  N&#xe4;ringsdepartementet f&#xf6;r det svenska st&#xf6;det till WMU.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to World Maritime University (WMU) running costs (in Malm&#xf6;). WMU sorts under IMO. Provides internat masters courses related to different maritime subsectors, primarily for persons fr dev  countries. 2008 Sida disbursed half of planned annual contribution and the MinForAff remaining half. From 1 Jan 2009 the Ministry of Industry is responsible for the Swed support to WMU.</narrative>
  </description>
